        },
        {
          "number": 2,
          "isChorus": false,
          "text": "Thy love divine hath led us in the past;\nin this free land with thee our lot is cast;\nbe thou our ruler, guardian, guide, and stay,\nthy Word our law, thy paths our chosen way."
        },
        {
          "number": 3,
          "isChorus": false,
          "text": "From war's alarms, from deadly pestilence,\nbe thy strong arm our ever sure defense;\nthy true religion in our hearts increase;\nthy bounteous goodness nourish us in peace."
        },
        {
          "number": 4,
          "isChorus": false,
          "text": "Refresh thy people on their toilsome way;\nlead us from night to never-ending day;\nfill all our lives with love and grace divine,\nand glory, laud, and praise be ever thine."
        }
