          "isChorus": false,
          "text": "Crown him the Lord of love;\nbehold his hands and side,\nrich wounds, yet visible above,\nin beauty glorified;\nno angels in the sky\ncan fully bear that sight,\nbut downward bends their burning eye\nat mysteries so bright."
